      <description>&lt;p&gt;In your quest to utilize the sort functionality while querying MongoDB databases via PyMongo, it&amp;rsquo;s common to face challenges that may not occur when utilizing the MongoDB shell. If you&amp;rsquo;re encountering issues, worry not! Below, I outline several strategies to effectively sort your results in MongoDB with PyMongo, ensuring robust performance and correct syntax.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;whats-not-working&#34;&gt;What’s Not Working?&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Consider the original query:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-python&#34; data-lang=&#34;python&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; pymongo&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; pymongo &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; MongoClient&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;client &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; MongoClient()&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;db &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; client&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;myDB&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;print(db&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;posts&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;count_documents({}))&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; post &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; db&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;posts&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;find({}, {&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;entities.user_mentions.screen_name&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;})&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;sort({&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;u&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;entities.user_mentions.screen_name&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;}):&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    print(post)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;If this isn&amp;rsquo;t functioning as expected, the typical error message may be:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
